    "title": "Senior Full-Stack (<span class=\"highlight\">React</span> / Next.<span class=\"highlight\">js</span> / Supabase / AI-Assisted <span class=\"highlight\">Development</span>) – Build a Document Intake",
    "description": ",\n\nI’m building a real-world SaaS platform called HSVM (Ho So Viet My).\n\nThis is not a marketing website.\n\nIt is a document intake and case management system for customers handling immigration, consular, passport, apostille, and legal document services between the United States and Vietnam.\n\nThe customer experience is already fully designed.\n\nI have:\n\n* Complete customer workflow\n* UX/UI wireframes\n* Page designs\n* Business rules\n* Service database\n* Content\n* Internal workflow\n* Trust philosophy\n* MVP roadmap\n\nApproximately 13 design documents have already been prepared.\n\nI need an experienced engineer who can turn this system into a production-ready SaaS.\n\n⸻\n\nTech stack (preferred)\n\n* Next.<span class=\"highlight\">js</span>\n* <span class=\"highlight\">React</span>\n* TypeScript\n* Tailwind CSS\n* Supabase\n* PostgreSQL\n* AI-assisted <span class=\"highlight\">development</span> (Cursor, Claude Code, Lovable, etc.)\n\n⸻\n\nCore features\n\n* Homepage\n* Service directory\n* Dynamic service pages\n* Secure document upload\n* Public case tracking\n* Customer dashboard\n* Admin dashboard\n* Authentication\n* Email notifications\n* Search\n* File management\n* Responsive design\n\n⸻\n\nImportant\n\nI value:\n\n* clean architecture\n* simple UX\n* scalable code\n* maintainability\n* speed\n\nI do not want unnecessary complexity.\n\n⸻\n\nBefore applying\n\nPlease answer:\n\n1. How would you architect this project?\n2. Fixed-price estimate?\n3. Timeline?\n4. What would you build first?\n5. What would you postpone until Version 2?\n6. Have you built similar SaaS products?\n\n⸻\n\nI will provide\n\n* Full specifications\n* Wireframes\n* Design system\n* Workflow documents\n* Business logic\n* Ongoing feedback\n\n⸻\n\nLong-term opportunity\n\nIf we work well together, this will become a long-term project with future AI features and automation.",
